.TH RUSTYPE-SETTINGS 1 "November 2026" "Rustype 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rustype-settings \- Graphical preferences editor and diagnostic tool for the Rustype input method
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rustype-settings
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rustype-settings
is the native desktop configuration tool for Rustype. Built with GTK4 and Libadwaita, it adheres to the modern GNOME Human Interface Guidelines (HIG), supporting automatic system dark and light appearance.
.PP
The tool runs as an independent preferences utility that modifies \fI~/.config/rustype/config\fR. It is decoupled from the input method process, \fBrustype-linux\fR, so the engine keeps no GUI dependencies in memory. Changes made in the settings app are detected and reloaded automatically by the running engine.
.SH SECTIONS
.TP
.B General (Chung)
Configure input method (Telex or VNI), display mode (Auto, Preedit underline, or Direct), modern orthography (e.g. "hoà" vs "hòa"), English word auto-restore, and per-app state remembering.
.TP
.B Macros (Gõ tắt)
Manage abbreviation tables. Supports adding, editing, and deleting shortcut phrases, as well as importing and exporting Unikey-compatible macro tables.
.TP
.B App Modes (Theo ứng dụng)
Define display overrides for specific applications, for example forcing a terminal application to use underlined preedit.
.TP
.B Custom Words (Từ điển tiếng Anh)
Maintain an exclusion list of English or programming words that should never receive Vietnamese diacritics.
.TP
.B About & Diagnostics (Thông tin & Chẩn đoán)
Display version and license information, and run the system diagnostic check (\fBrustype-linux --doctor\fR) with graphical status reports. The application checks for updates only when the user presses the update button.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h\fR, \fB\-\-help
Show graphical application help and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/rustype/config
User configuration file edited by this application.
.TP
.I ~/.config/rustype/macro
Active macro abbreviations file.
.TP
.I ~/.config/rustype/words
User-defined English words dictionary.
